---

Thanks for opening a support post! If you haven't already, please provide:
- A Geyser dump: Run !!dump to learn how to generate one.
- A description of the issue: What issue are you experiencing? Feel free to include screenshots of client errors, logs via mclo.gs, and information about how you're hosting Geyser.

Once your issue is resolved, you can close this post with `/post close`.
Please be patient. Someone will get back to you as soon as they are available and equipped to assist with your issue.